  "title": "A standard page's Page Size choice is one PSPNLDEFN.PNLUSE bit (0x4 800x600, 0x20 / 0x40 in / without portal, 0x800 / 0x80 1024x768, 0x200 / 0x400 Var, 0x8 Custom)",
  "statement": "Page Properties Page Size on a standard page is stored as one PSPNLDEFN.PNLUSE bit: none for 640x480 Windows screen, 0x4 800x600 Windows screen, 0x20 800x600 page inside portal, 0x40 800x600 page without portal, 0x800 1024x768 page inside portal, 0x80 1024x768 page without portal, 0x200 240xVar, 0x400 490xVar, 0x8 Custom, replacing the previous one; PANELRIGHT / PANELBOTTOM take the preset's size (0 x 0 for 640x480), and Custom keeps the drawn size. The 640x480 save's window moved PDM by 2 (s01) and is not recorded here.",
  "confidence": "high",
  "compatibility": {
    "observedReleases": [
      "8.62.09"
    ],
    "knownIncompatible": []
  },
